{"3922680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Clueless: An Item Finder", "steam_appid": 3922680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clueless: An Item Finder</strong> is a puzzle/button finder game where you find the difference (The Button) to open the door and move on! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clueless was crafted as a bite‑sized <i>“Saturday morning”</i> experience: a complete, start‑to‑finish adventure you can enjoy in a short, relaxed session.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It all starts by pressing the button in the first room:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922680/extras/a14e5c088d4dd01cb39318d928b89751.poster.avif?t=1773868445\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922680/extras/a14e5c088d4dd01cb39318d928b89751.webm?t=1773868445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922680/extras/a14e5c088d4dd01cb39318d928b89751.mp4?t=1773868445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then comparing both rooms to find the difference, clicking the button and progressing to the next room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922680/extras/bed839762f9970f7cbe7c8abf63c8e46.poster.avif?t=1773868445\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922680/extras/bed839762f9970f7cbe7c8abf63c8e46.webm?t=1773868445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922680/extras/bed839762f9970f7cbe7c8abf63c8e46.mp4?t=1773868445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 7 types of rooms to go through, each with their own style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922680/extras/154512a4253ad1a5e0a69d9cebb34dc6.poster.avif?t=1773868445\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922680/extras/154512a4253ad1a5e0a69d9cebb34dc6.webm?t=1773868445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922680/extras/154512a4253ad1a5e0a69d9cebb34dc6.mp4?t=1773868445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the Difference</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the Button</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the Door</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >???</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Profit</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clueless: An Item Finder</strong> is a puzzle/button finder game where you find the difference (The Button) to open the door and move on! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clueless was crafted as a bite‑sized <i>“Saturday morning”</i> experience: a complete, start‑to‑finish adventure you can enjoy in a short, relaxed session.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It all starts by pressing the button in the first room:</p><p class=\"bb_pa